message:
Before you sign with a vendor, read the contract, not just the price.

Check:
• hours of coverage;
• overtime rates;
• cancellation and rescheduling terms;
• who the specific person working your wedding will be.

The cheapest quote with a vague contract often costs more than the clear one.

